ready: 1
kind: quality
id: agents.quality.hook-latency
display_id: QC-AGENTS-LATENCY
module: agents
title: Hook latency
applies_to: [agents.seq.hook]
measure: Wall time of the hook command from process start to output, with the daemon running and a stack of five thousand memories
target: At most 50 milliseconds at the 95th percentile for session start, prompt, and pre-tool events; no call exceeds the hook deadline.
